{
 "_doc": [
  "Layer map of the addon for tools/layers.py and check.py --layers (dev/docs/ARCHITECTURE_PLAN.md, 'Target layers').",
  "layers: the 7 layers in load order. A file may call its own layer and the ones below it.",
  "prefixes: layer of each path prefix, longest prefix wins. Holds today's folders AND the target folders of P4, so the",
  "  move only edits this file (drop the 'files' overrides of moved files), never the tool.",
  "files: per-file layer overrides for today's flat Core/ (feature logic, context, sync all live there until P4).",
  "features: [regex, feature] on the path, first match wins; the feature may use groups ('\\1'). Today's names first",
  "  (ported from the proposal's domain tagging), then the target folders.",
  "feature_order: the order inside the logic level (logic_layers); a feature may call earlier ones only. One list =",
  "  siblings of the same rank, which may not call each other.",
  "kit: files of this feature may not call files of the 'forbidden' features (at min_target_layer or above).",
  "wire: modules (and method regex) that count as addon-message code for the logic+wire report."
 ],
 "layers": {"0": "Platform", "1": "Game data", "2": "Context", "3": "Feature logic", "4": "Sync", "5": "UI", "6": "Games"},
 "prefixes": {
  "Core/": 0,
  "Data/": 1,
  "Data/Tours/": 5,
  "Logic/Context/": 2,
  "Logic/Items/": 2,
  "Logic/": 3,
  "Sim/": 3,
  "Sync/": 4,
  "Render3D/": 5,
  "UI/": 5,
  "Games/": 6
 },
 "files": {
